{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1106.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"60a12725339b1b2324d4479546524402ee460e221558f14df1c4610bb61ddc6b","ja":"あ、ふたりとも、お疲れさま～♪","zh":"啊，你们两个，辛苦啦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1106.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2f7dc0b1d08acc224c78d39a1f456f7a28dd0e15f9ec70be5a59d87161ef0449","ja":"あ、麗花さん、聞いてください！","zh":"啊，丽花小姐，请听我说！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1106.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"441c73c01c6ec93e87f1c2670e28ad2663c98652b29c48ac862e7064f50cc239","ja":"今、翼ちゃんと話してたんですけど……\n私たち、魔法で夢が叶っちゃったみたいなんです！","zh":"刚才我和小翼聊过了……\n我们的梦想，好像因为魔法而实现了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1106.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4a472dcb764856dfb9d096ece059350ee530d90e4c8c7ba464898e6e247cdfca","ja":"可奈ちゃん待って！？\nなんか変な説明になってるよ？　","zh":"可奈等等！？\n说明好像变得很奇怪了哦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1106.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"6b88b846fd1bf80350a928db3f1e2cc373687e14ce46ee6eb83018db8643a478","ja":"え～っと、本当に魔法が使えたんじゃなくて……\n「魔法で叶えたいこと」が実現した、みたいな？","zh":"嗯～与其说是真的能使用魔法……\n倒不如说像是“想用魔法实现的愿望”实现了，这种感觉？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1106.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"a35aa19a2f2defa47e94b60ce330b413f7813f55d1aa0b2ff1cb315259b8f0c4","ja":"わぁっ、とっても素敵♪\nふたりとも、魔法使いになったんだね！","zh":"哇，真棒♪\n两个人，都变成魔法使了呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1106.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"d1780cea8be866107dcff9c1d508f3818d5777e3dc42470a44edaadcd6ae1548","ja":"そうなんです！　……あれ？\nやっぱりちょっとちがうかも。え～っと……。","zh":"就是这样！……咦？\n好像还是有点不对。呃……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1106.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b17cb126618163e59bf65b0ba1577fc0664ea8b012e9636eafa7d74377ffcdc1","ja":"私、前に「けるちゃんと一緒に空を飛びたい」って\n言ったら、そういうPV撮影のお仕事が入ったんです！","zh":"我之前说过“想和小青蛙一起在天上飞”，\n结果真的接到了这种MV拍摄的工作！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1106.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"3f8abac795c8c711cc7efb3934efc3220d137c0597f63a2efdd605ec499bed28","ja":"わたしは「洋服をいーっぱい出したい」って言ったら、\n雑誌の企画でたくさんの服が試着できたんですよ！","zh":"我说想“推出好多好多漂亮的衣服”，\n结果在杂志企划里试穿了好多套衣服呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1106.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"aaa07e095eb3c2e98fb3fabe6967b0467f907f94f915b99405d32b0a652e285b","ja":"そうなんだ～♪　それじゃあやっぱり、\nふたりは魔法使いになれたんだね♪","zh":"是这样啊～♪　那也就是说，\n你们两个果然变成魔法使了呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1106.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"24e4a48e334e62490b48a9f18aad23ca61341ab1c6a26a66b05ddd4e6ea504ce","ja":"ええっ！？　どういうことですか～？","zh":"咦！？　这是怎么回事呀～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1106.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"8ddea9d7e3890aaca2625820912153c7ae0dd2200e7ade7693a7c10066f9624c","ja":"翼ちゃんも可奈ちゃんも、これまで頑張ってきたから\n夢みたいなお仕事ができるようになったんでしょ？","zh":"翼和可奈也是因为一直以来都很努力，\n才能接到像梦一样的工作的吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1106.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"a75d74c2f97a9260d0bb290d831a88fb0ba9c7e86d1907ad4dec3a5d3c0d486b","ja":"だからそれは、ふたりの魔法だよ！\n頑張っててえらい！　パチパチパチ～♪","zh":"所以说，那是属于我们两人的魔法哦！\n你这么努力真了不起！啪啪啪～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1106.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"8e2b8a807d698efb8ea51dfbd96fe5691731cca8a4bbe7e006d8766fadedf1f7","ja":"麗花さん……えへへ。ありがとうございます！\nそっか、無理そうな夢でも、頑張れば叶うんですね！","zh":"丽花小姐……嘿嘿。谢谢你！\n原来就算是看似不可能的梦想，只要努力也是能实现的呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1106.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"004033d3b8bae21748879bf8241203624a59a5ad8874b519abf2b8d0503dbe59","ja":"そうかも！　自分の夢が叶うって思ったら、\nこれからもちょっとだけ頑張れる……かな♪","zh":"说得也是！一想到自己的梦想能够实现，\n感觉今后也能稍微再努努力……吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1106.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"795742ee267e804415db6b126b96ccc795f7a77c0082cc9ee67e6214fbe6f685","ja":"私もお仕事、頑張りたいな。そうしたらいつか……\n世界中の山を登れる日が来るかも♪","zh":"我也想好好努力工作呢。这样一来，说不定某天……\n就能迎来攀登世界各地名山的那一天♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1106.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"9cc717f7c1ad83722b37736a51897d3c8fa09087af6f9a74bf68d0dc91e85cd9","ja":"きっと来ますよ！　みんなで目指そう魔法使い～♪\n叶えたい夢がいっぱい～♪","zh":"一定会来的！　大家一起以成为魔法使为目标吧～♪\n想要实现的梦想数不胜数～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
